# Backend — environment templates
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# TEST (dev):   cp .env.dev.example .env.dev   →  npm run deploy
# LIVE (prod):  cp .env.prod.example .env.prod →  npm run deploy:prod
#
# Or run from project root:  .\scripts\set-razorpay-test-keys.ps1
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Switching TEST → LIVE after deployment:
#   1. Fill backend/.env.prod with rzp_live_* keys + live webhook secret
#   2. npm run deploy:prod
#   3. Update app .env: EXPO_PUBLIC_RAZORPAY_MODE=live + rzp_live_* key ID
#   4. Rebuild app: npx expo run:android
